<title>JAPAN: Brunei cuts Apr crude price by 85 cts/bbl-traders.</title>
<headline>Brunei cuts Apr crude price by 85 cts/bbl-traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brunei has cut the price of its April-loading crude oil by 85 cents per barrel for both Champion and Seria Light, traders said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
